Another quantifier we haven't mentioned yet is "no'oi" (plural "no"):

    no prenu cu kakne lo nu muvgau lo vi pipno
    "No person can move this piano."

     no'oi prenu cu kakne lo nu muvgau lo vi cmana
    "No number of people can move this mountain."

There's also "me'ei", the plural "me'i":

      me'i prenu cu nermapti lo vi karce
      "Not every person will fit into this car."

      me'ei prenu cu nermapti lo vi karce
      "Not any number of people will fit into this car."

mu'o mi'e xorxes

